  "title": "National CineMedia and TransUnion Partner to Bring Cinema into Cross-Channel Attribution",
  "summary": "National CineMedia (NCM) and TransUnion have partnered to integrate NCM’s theatrical exposure data into TransUnion’s cross platform attribution solution. The collaboration gives advertisers full-funnel, data-driven visibility into how cinema ads drive performance alongside digital, CTV, social and other channels.",
